# Sanitizing

An inline image with an event handler: `<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>`{=html}

A [javascript: link](javascript:alert(2)).

``` =html
<script>alert(3)</script>
<p onclick="alert(4)">A raw paragraph with an onclick attribute.</p>
<a href="javascript:alert(5)">A raw javascript: link.</a>
<img id="title" name="title" src="x"><form name="cookie"></form>
<section id="cookie">A raw section whose id is kept.</section>
```

Harmless raw HTML is kept: `<kbd>Ctrl</kbd>`{=html}.
